# Header and banner lock

When the user asks for any other site change, do **not** change the header or the banner unless they explicitly name that part.

## Header (nav only)

From the top of the page through the nav bar:

- Spark logo, Home, About us, Services, My Work, Testimonial, Contact Me
- Same links, labels, order, pill bar, and Contact Me button

Do not restyle, recolor, reorder, or move the header.

## Banner (hero)

From just under the nav through the photo block:

- “Hi! I’m Ufaq…”
- Creative Designer & Developer
- Tagline
- Girl photo, Portfolio ribbon, glow behind the photo, round ↓ / Let’s explore button

Do not restyle, recolor, rewrite, crop, or move the banner. Do not swap the photo or ribbon.

## Allowed

Other sections may change (mission, work, services, skills, testimonials, contact, Thanks, spacing below the banner, inner pages).

If a requested change would alter header or banner, skip that part and say so. Only edit them when the user clearly asks to change the header or the banner.
